      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHAUN SHANNON (2) came from this barrier to win here last month and has placed in two of four outings since. Led at his most recent outing and finished second over this distance, beaten 1.2 metres. Likely to get the favours from this nice draw so has winning claims. LEXY LONGSTOCKINGS (4) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when midfield after racing parked. Recorded a series of wins of placings prior and goes up to a distance where her record is sound. KARINYA HAZ (5) is proven here and is worth plenty of thought off an easy last-start win by 19 metres at Cowra when off a similar barrier. OCEAN KING (1) has been coming from wider barriers, winning here three back. Should not have any excuses from the favourable draw.",
